# Object Property: <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000050> (is tetragonal)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000050> "is tetragonal"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000050> "is tetragonal is a object property  for the inference of family of directions/planes Miller indices notation under tetragonal symmetry. The class crystallographic entity in tetragonal system carries a Self restriction \"is tetragonal\""@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000050> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000053>)

# Object Property: <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000053> (has symmetry)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000053> "DO NOT USE DIRECTLY
For taxonomy purpose only")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000053> "has symmetry"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000053> "has symmetry is a top-level object property which gathers other symmetry/lattice system-specific object properties for the inference of family of directions/planes Miller indices notation"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000053> owl:topObjectProperty)

